  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": 302,
      "sort_order": 10,
      "published": true,
      "data": {
        "title": "Cómo funciona el alfabeto fonético de la OTAN",
        "text": "<p><strong>El alfabeto fonético de la OTAN</strong> asigna a cada letra latina una palabra clave: A es <em>Alfa</em>, B es <em>Bravo</em> y C es <em>Charlie</em>. Sirve para transmitir nombres, distintivos, números y códigos por radio o teléfono cuando hay ruido.</p><p>Introduce letras latinas y números para codificarlos, o cambia al modo de descifrado. Puedes elegir NATO/ICAO, números de aviación, LAPD o DIN&nbsp;5009, el separador, el formato «A = Alfa» y la reproducción en el navegador.</p>"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "sort_order": 20,
      "published": true,
      "data": {
        "title": "Tabla del alfabeto fonético de la OTAN",
        "text": "<div class=\"nato-ref\"><p class=\"nato-ref__intro\">Cada letra tiene una palabra clave inequívoca; la guía muestra el acento prescrito.</p><ul class=\"nato-ref__grid\"><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">A</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Alfa</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">AL-FAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">B</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Bravo</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">BRAH-VOH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">C</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Charlie</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">CHAR-LEE</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">D</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Delta</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">DELL-TAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">E</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Echo</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">ECK-OH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">F</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Foxtrot</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">FOKS-TROT</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">G</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Golf</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">GOLF</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">H</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Hotel</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">HOH-TELL</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">I</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">India</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">IN-DEE-AH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">J</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Juliett</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">JEW-LEE-ETT</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">K</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Kilo</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">KEY-LOH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">L</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Lima</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">LEE-MAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">M</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Mike</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">MIKE</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">N</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">November</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">NO-VEM-BER</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">O</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Oscar</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">OSS-CAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">P</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Papa</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">PAH-PAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">Q</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Quebec</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">KEH-BECK</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">R</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Romeo</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">ROW-ME-OH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">S</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Sierra</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">SEE-AIR-RAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">T</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Tango</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">TANG-GO</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">U</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Uniform</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">YOU-NEE-FORM</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">V</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Victor</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">VIK-TAH</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">W</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Whiskey</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">WISS-KEY</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">X</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">X-ray</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">ECKS-RAY</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">Y</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Yankee</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">YANG-KEY</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">Z</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Zulu</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">ZOO-LOO</span></span></li></ul><h3 class=\"nato-ref__subtitle\">Números</h3><ul class=\"nato-ref__grid nato-ref__grid--numbers\"><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">0</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Zero</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">ZEE-RO</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">1</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">One</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">WUN</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">2</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Two</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">TOO</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">3</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Three</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">TREE</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">4</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Four</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">FOWER</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">5</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Five</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">FIFE</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">6</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Six</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">SIX</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">7</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Seven</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">SEV-EN</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">8</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Eight</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">AIT</span></span></li><li class=\"nato-ref__card\"><span class=\"nato-ref__letter\">9</span><span class=\"nato-ref__body\"><span class=\"nato-ref__word\">Nine</span><span class=\"nato-ref__say\">NIN-ER</span></span></li></ul></div>"
      }
    }
